Optional daily limit for segment emails, set with MAUTIC_BROADCAST_DAILY_LIMIT.
When set, mautic:broadcasts:send sends at most that many segment emails in
any 24 hours, counted across all segment emails, and the Send button in the
email list is replaced by a notice, so sending happens only on schedule.
Unset or 0 keeps the stock behaviour.

